DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260919
DTSTAMP:20260917T152608Z
UID:bc6b86d20a99aa8d8299a7a4e651@ctvisit-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Growing up on Long Island\, Kenn was inspired by such melody-m
 inded acts as Gordon Lightfoot\, Simon and Garfunkel\, Graham Nash\, and J
 ackson Browne. The KMB enthralls audiences of all sizes\, from intimate co
 ffeehouses to the stages of venues as demanding as the famed Bitter End in
  New York City and the International Festival of Arts and Ideas on the New
  Haven Green. They feature violin virtuoso and multi instrumentalist Tom H
 agymasi and melodic bassist/vocalist Pat Ryan\, a graduate of the Berklee 
 College of Music.\n\nSource: https://ctvisit.com/events/summer-music-serie
 s-featuring-kenn-morr-band
