DESCRIPTION:Join the Roger Tory Peterson Estuary Center for our Annual Fun
 draiser on Friday\, September 18\, from 5:30–8 p.m. Enjoy an intimate co
 cktail party along the Lieutenant River as we celebrate the art of bonsai 
 and the native plants of the Connecticut River Watershed. Discover how bon
 sai techniques can showcase the beauty and versatility of native plants wh
 ile supporting thriving local ecosystems. Proceeds support RTPEC’s envir
 onmental education\, science\, research and conservation programs.\n\nSour
 ce: https://ctvisit.com/events/wonder-bonsai-transforming-native-plants
LOCATION:Roger Tory Peterson Estuary Center\, 100 Lyme Street\, Old Lyme C
 T\, 06371
