 tion Road\, Windsor. This year marks the 30th anniversary of the Windsor F
 reedom Trail. Learn about and celebrate the rich history of the Windsor Fr
 eedom Trail with your family and friends by visiting sites that are associ
 ated with African American contributions\, heritage\, movement towards fre
 edom\, and the Underground Railroad.\n\nSource: https://ctvisit.com/events
 /windsor-freedom-trail-run-1
